  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "This one gets your youngest players trying the moves they've seen on telly.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Three stations. A step-over at the cone, a Cruyff at the mannequin, a drag-back at the gate.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 8.29,
   "text": "Dribble in at pace, sell the move with the shoulders, then burst away.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 21.18,
   "text": "Both feet at every station, then rotate. Finish with a free run, any move.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 23.02,
   "text": "Once they're flying, swap one mannequin for a defender who only walks.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "progression"
  },
  {
   "t": 25.52,
   "text": "The acceleration after the trick is the point. A move at walking pace fools nobody.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "why"
  }
